# Eden Bespoke Flowers

[Open the portfolio demo](https://montychaudhary.com/?monty_demo=eden-bespoke-flowers)

Weddings, funerals and events each have a page so visitors can go straight to the kind of flowers they need. The contact form turns the details a visitor enters into an enquiry they can copy.

## Try it

Open **Weddings** or **Funerals** from the home page. Then open **Contact**, enter sample details and see the enquiry the form prepares.

This is an independent portfolio concept with illustrative photography. To preview the source locally, download the repo and open `index.html` in a browser.
